{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the Master of Pasta!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this single-player simulation game, you manage your own pasta restaurant \u2014 both as the head chef and the business owner. Start the day with a limited budget: buy ingredients, pay your waiter and dishwasher, and don\u2019t forget the rent! Earn money and raise your restaurant rating by preparing all orders on time and without mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful: serve something incomplete, and customers will be unhappy \u2014 your restaurant rating could crash. On some days, surprise characters may visit your restaurant. Some will help you, while others might cause chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for ingredient management, timing, planning, and loads of fun. In a sweet and simple atmosphere with charming visuals, it\u2019s time for you to shine in the kitchen!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883270?t=1755684616","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3883270?t=1755684616","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/4d29616a48bb4a4e677745f17448cc9c8c927765/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755684616","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3883270/4d29616a48bb4a4e677745f17448cc9c8c927765/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755684616","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the Master of Pasta!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this single-player simulation game, you manage your own pasta restaurant \u2014 both as the head chef and the business owner. Start the day with a limited budget: buy ingredients, pay your waiter and dishwasher, and don\u2019t forget the rent! Ea